          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "استقبال (istiqbāl) is built on the native Arabic root q-b-l, \"to be in front of; to accept\" (Lane). It is the verbal noun of Form X, \"going out to meet\"."
            }
          ]
        },
